# Light = pale raspberry glass, dark text. The tint echoes the dark bg (1a0810)
# so ghostty keeps its raspberry identity in both modes. Mirrors kitty's
# colors-light.conf (which uses a green tint). Transparent so the wallpaper
# reads through; the tint only shows where it's opaque.
# Muted dusty raspberry — low-saturation (like kitty's near-neutral green) so it
# blends as a subtle frosted tint rather than a loud pink, echoing ghostty's dark
# maroon identity. Opacity lives in the main config (ghostty ignores it here).
# Renders correctly now that the blur brightness washout is fixed (30-look.conf).
